					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Welcome to the new Crusaders of Ilk website!  Members need to create a login for themselves and then create the character(s) that they have in the guild.  I recommend that you use your primary character's name for your login name.  For example, my login name is &quot;Bonestriker&quot;, and my characters are &quot;Bonestriker&quot;, &quot;Dyaan&quot;, and &quot;Finch&quot;.<br />
<br />
Officers, please use your officer character as your login -- it will make it much easier for members to find the officers that way.<br />
<br />
Once you've created your character(s), please let an officer know and we'll validate your character.<br />
<br />
Have fun!
